  "$comment": "National enforcement bodies (NEB) and ADR schemes. EU261 Art. 16: the NEB of the state where the departure airport is, or the arrival airport for inbound flights from third countries. UK261: the CAA, or the airline's approved ADR scheme if it is a member. ADR membership is airline-specific. EVERY entry must be verified by a human; nothing with verified=false is shown to users.",
